  "english_paragraphs": [
    "I have been studying and working in China for three years. Five years ago, I traveled to China for the first time and fell in love with the food here. After returning to China, I started learning Chinese online. At first I studied by myself, and later I found a Chinese teacher online to help me. After I passed the HSK Level 4 exam, I wanted to come to China to continue my studies. After arriving in China, I first studied Chinese in Beijing, then found a job in Shanghai and came to live in Shanghai. Over the past three years, I have learned more about Chinese culture and made many Chinese friends. I want to work in Guangdong next year. Guangdong is a warm place with a lot of delicious food. I should be very happy."
  ],
  "english_full": "I have been studying and working in China for three years. Five years ago, I traveled to China for the first time and fell in love with the food here. After returning to China, I started learning Chinese online. At first I studied by myself, and later I found a Chinese teacher online to help me. After I passed the HSK Level 4 exam, I wanted to come to China to continue my studies. After arriving in China, I first studied Chinese in Beijing, then found a job in Shanghai and came to live in Shanghai. Over the past three years, I have learned more about Chinese culture and made many Chinese friends. I want to work in Guangdong next year. Guangdong is a warm place with a lot of delicious food. I should be very happy.",
